oracle_id":"c82091b2-f2f1-4a85-80d6-91ab218f0a94","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Farsight Mask must be untapped both when the damage is dealt and when you would draw the card.","oracle_id":"c82091b2-f2f1-4a85-80d6-91ab218f0a94","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This triggers each time a source an opponent controls deals damage to you. If the same source deals damage more than once in a turn, it triggers for each of those times.","oracle_id":"c82091b2-f2f1-4a85-80d6-91ab218f0a94","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You draw no more than one card each time a source an opponent controls damages you, no matter how much damage the source deals.","oracle_id":"c82091b2-f2f1-4a85-80d6-91ab218f0a94","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
